chart — clinical patient-notes query-routing demo

CODE: MIT (the demo glue — indexer, search backends, functions, eval harness).

DATA: the corpus is PMC-Patients (zhengyun21/PMC-Patients), licensed
CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 (Attribution — NonCommercial — ShareAlike). This demo is
therefore NON-COMMERCIAL. Attribution:

  Zhao et al., "PMC-Patients: A Large-scale Dataset of Patient Summaries and
  Relations for Benchmarking Retrieval-based Clinical Decision Systems."
  arXiv:2202.13876 / Scientific Data (2023).

The notes are published, de-identified case reports — NOT raw EHR data, and NOT
for clinical use. This is a search demo and gives no medical advice.

